key.axolotlextras.quickplay=Quickplay Menu
axolotlextras.section.oldvisuals=1.7 visuals
axolotlextras.oldBlockHitting=Block Hitting
axolotlextras.oldBlockHitting.tooltip=The sword, food and bow animations keep swinging when you swing while holding right click, like in 1.7.
axolotlextras.oldFirstPerson=1.7 Item Positions
axolotlextras.oldFirstPerson.tooltip=Held items sit in your hand the way they did in 1.7: the position and size of items and blocks, the bow pose and the fishing rod.
axolotlextras.oldSneak=1.7 Sneaking
axolotlextras.oldSneak.tooltip=The camera goes down at once when you sneak and comes back up slowly when you stop, like in 1.7.
axolotlextras.oldThirdPerson=1.7 Sword Block (outside view)
axolotlextras.oldThirdPerson.tooltip=How other players and the third person camera see a blocking sword: the arm straight up in front and the sword turned, like in 1.7.
axolotlextras.reliableStats=Reliable Bed Wars Stats
axolotlextras.reliableStats.tooltip=Loads every player's Bed Wars stats from Hypixel at the start of a game, a few at a time, and asks again after a failure. Without it AxolotlClient asks once and most players stay at a question mark. Needs a Hypixel API key in the AxolotlClient settings.
axolotlextras.hacks=Hacks
axolotlextras.openHacks=Modern Hacks Menu
axolotlextras.section.esp=ESP
axolotlextras.section.bedwarsInfo=Bed Wars info
axolotlextras.playerEsp=Player ESP
axolotlextras.playerEsp.tooltip=Draws a box around every other player, through walls, in their team colour. Invisible players are included. NPCs are skipped.
axolotlextras.espTracers=Tracers
axolotlextras.espTracers.tooltip=Draws a line from the middle of the screen to every other player, in their team colour.
axolotlextras.generatorCounts=Generator Counts
axolotlextras.generatorCounts.tooltip=Shows how much iron, gold, diamond and emerald lies at each generator, with the resource icons, through walls. Only generators within the server's item range (about 64 blocks) are known.
axolotlextras.bedDefense=Bed Defense
axolotlextras.bedDefense.tooltip=Shows the blocks around each bed with their icons and counts, innermost first, through walls, with the team letter when it can tell. "Open" means a face of the bed touches air.
axolotlextras.obsidianAlert=Obsidian Alert
axolotlextras.obsidianAlert.tooltip=A short chat line (only you see it) when an enemy bed gets obsidian: its team, how many spots of the layer are obsidian (8/8 is a full inner layer) and how far away it is. Works with Bed Defense switched off.
axolotlextras.obsidianWaypoints=Obsidian Waypoints
axolotlextras.obsidianWaypoints.tooltip=A beam in the team colour and a label over every bed the Obsidian Alert reported, until the obsidian or the bed is gone.
axolotlextras.enemyArmor=Enemy Armor
axolotlextras.enemyArmor.tooltip=Above each enemy's head: their armor (leggings show the tier) with its Protection level as the item count, and their held item with Sharpness or Knockback.
axolotlextras.armorProtection=Show Protection Level
axolotlextras.armorProtection.tooltip=Enemy Armor shows the Protection level as the number on the armor icon, the way AxolotlClient's Armor HUD shows yours. Off: no number.
axolotlextras.noBlindness=No Blindness
axolotlextras.noBlindness.tooltip=Takes away the dark fog of the blindness effect. Drawing only: the effect itself (no sprinting) stays.
axolotlextras.section.vision=Vision
axolotlextras.nametags=Nametags Through Walls
axolotlextras.nametags.tooltip=Every other player's name in their team colour, their health (from the server's health score, so no made-up numbers) and how far away they are, through walls.
axolotlextras.rushAlert=Rush Alert
axolotlextras.rushAlert.tooltip=A chat line and a sound when an enemy (or with Rush: Include Teammates, anyone) comes near your bed. Your bed is found from your team colour and where you stood when the game started.
axolotlextras.rushDistance=Rush Distance
axolotlextras.rushDistance.tooltip=How near an enemy has to get to your bed for the Rush Alert.
axolotlextras.rush.15=15 blocks
axolotlextras.rush.25=25 blocks
axolotlextras.rush.40=40 blocks
axolotlextras.fireballWarning=Fireball Warning
axolotlextras.fireballWarning.tooltip=Shows where each flying fireball will hit, marks the soft blocks (wool, wood) the blast is likely to break, and plays a sound when one is coming at you. The marked blocks are an estimate.
axolotlextras.pearlLanding=Pearl Landing
axolotlextras.pearlLanding.tooltip=Shows the flight and the landing block of every flying ender pearl, yours and everyone else's.
axolotlextras.trajectories=Trajectories
axolotlextras.trajectories.tooltip=While you hold a pearl, snowball or egg, or draw a bow, a line shows where it would fly and hit. It turns green when it would hit a player.
axolotlextras.section.projectiles=Projectiles
axolotlextras.espInvisible=ESP: Show Invisible
axolotlextras.espInvisible.tooltip=ESP, tracers and nametags also show players with the invisibility effect. The radar has its own switch (Radar: Show Invisible).
axolotlextras.espTeammates=ESP: Show Teammates
axolotlextras.espTeammates.tooltip=ESP, tracers and nametags also show your teammates (the radar has its own switch). Off: enemies only. Your team is read from the Bed Wars sidebar.
axolotlextras.espStyle=ESP Style
axolotlextras.espStyle.tooltip=The ESP box: an outline, a see-through fill, or both.
axolotlextras.espStyle.outline=Outline
axolotlextras.espStyle.filled=Filled
axolotlextras.espStyle.both=Both
axolotlextras.espColor=ESP Color
axolotlextras.espColor.tooltip=The ESP and tracer colour: the team colour, the distance (red near, green 64 blocks or more away) or the health (green full, red low; white when the health is not known).
axolotlextras.espColor.team=Team
axolotlextras.espColor.distance=Distance
axolotlextras.espColor.health=Health
axolotlextras.espRange=ESP Range
axolotlextras.espRange.tooltip=How far away players are still shown by ESP, tracers, nametags and enemy armor.
axolotlextras.range.32=32 blocks
axolotlextras.range.64=64 blocks
axolotlextras.range.128=128 blocks
axolotlextras.range.all=Everyone loaded
axolotlextras.nametagHealth=Nametag Health
axolotlextras.nametagHealth.tooltip=Nametags show the health.
axolotlextras.nametagDistance=Nametag Distance
axolotlextras.nametagDistance.tooltip=Nametags show how far away the player is.
axolotlextras.armorHeld=Show Held Item
axolotlextras.armorHeld.tooltip=Enemy Armor also shows what the enemy holds, with its Sharpness or Knockback level.
axolotlextras.genIron=Count Iron
axolotlextras.genIron.tooltip=Generator Counts shows iron.
axolotlextras.genGold=Count Gold
axolotlextras.genGold.tooltip=Generator Counts shows gold.
axolotlextras.genDiamond=Count Diamonds
axolotlextras.genDiamond.tooltip=Generator Counts shows diamonds.
axolotlextras.genEmerald=Count Emeralds
axolotlextras.genEmerald.tooltip=Generator Counts shows emeralds.
axolotlextras.invisAlert=Invisibility Alert
axolotlextras.invisAlert.tooltip=A short chat line (only you see it) when an enemy you can see goes invisible, and for 60 seconds a see-through box where it happened with a line the way they were looking. Someone who comes into range already invisible gives no alert: there is no telling where they drank.
axolotlextras.invisNeedPotion=Only After a Potion
axolotlextras.invisNeedPotion.tooltip=The Invisibility Alert only counts an enemy who was seen holding an invisibility potion in the 3 seconds before going invisible. Off: any enemy who turns invisible in front of you counts. Players leaving your render distance never count either way: they are simply gone from your side.
axolotlextras.invisWaypoints=Invisibility Waypoints
axolotlextras.invisWaypoints.tooltip=A beam in the team colour and a label (name, seconds ago, distance) over each invisibility mark, like the obsidian waypoints.
axolotlextras.hiddenTrail=Hidden Player Trail
axolotlextras.hiddenTrail.tooltip=A breadcrumb trail of players you cannot see (Hypixel stops sending invisible players), built from what the server still sends for them: footstep, hurt, drink and bow sounds, footstep particles, and blocks being broken. A sound only counts when no player or mob is loaded at that spot. Each crumb sits in the middle of the lower block a player takes up, and crumbs of one walk are joined by a line. Sneaking players make no footstep sounds.
axolotlextras.trailTime=Trail Time
axolotlextras.trailTime.tooltip=How long each crumb of the hidden trail stays.
axolotlextras.seconds.5=5 seconds
axolotlextras.seconds.10=10 seconds
axolotlextras.seconds.20=20 seconds
axolotlextras.seconds.30=30 seconds
axolotlextras.trailStyle=Trail Style
axolotlextras.trailStyle.tooltip=Markers: small cubes and lines drawn through walls. Particles: coloured dust in the world (walls hide it).
axolotlextras.trailStyle.markers=Markers
axolotlextras.trailStyle.particles=Particles
axolotlextras.trailLabels=Trail Labels
axolotlextras.trailLabels.tooltip=A label over the newest crumb of each trail: the name when an Invisibility Alert mark tells who it is (else "Hidden"), seconds since and distance.
axolotlextras.trailChat=Trail Chat Line
axolotlextras.trailChat.tooltip=A short chat line (only you see it) when a new hidden trail starts after 5 quiet seconds.
axolotlextras.invisSound=Invisibility Sound
axolotlextras.invisSound.tooltip=The Invisibility Alert plays a sound with its chat line.
axolotlextras.bedDefenseOwn=Show Own Bed
axolotlextras.bedDefenseOwn.tooltip=Bed Defense also labels your own bed.
axolotlextras.obsidianSound=Obsidian Sound
axolotlextras.obsidianSound.tooltip=The Obsidian Alert plays a sound with its chat line.
axolotlextras.rushSound=Rush Sound
axolotlextras.rushSound.tooltip=The Rush Alert plays a sound with its chat line.
axolotlextras.rushTeammates=Rush: Include Teammates
axolotlextras.rushTeammates.tooltip=The Rush Alert also counts your teammates when they come near your bed, marked [Teammate] after the name. Off (default): enemies only. Teammates are told by the team letter and colour in front of their name; gray players without one (spectators, players waiting to respawn) are never counted.
axolotlextras.fireballBlocks=Mark Blast Blocks
axolotlextras.fireballBlocks.tooltip=The Fireball Warning marks the blocks the blast will likely break (an estimate).
axolotlextras.fireballSound=Fireball Sound
axolotlextras.fireballSound.tooltip=The Fireball Warning plays a sound when a fireball is coming at you.
axolotlextras.trajectoryBow=Bow Trajectory
axolotlextras.trajectoryBow.tooltip=Trajectories while you draw a bow.
axolotlextras.trajectoryThrown=Throw Trajectory
axolotlextras.trajectoryThrown.tooltip=Trajectories while you hold a pearl, snowball or egg.
axolotlextras.labelSizeGenerators=Generator Counts
axolotlextras.labelSizeGenerators.tooltip=The size of the Generator Counts labels, from 25% to 200%. Drag the bar or click on it.
axolotlextras.labelSizeBeds=Bed Defense
axolotlextras.labelSizeBeds.tooltip=The size of the Bed Defense labels.
axolotlextras.labelSizeWaypoints=Waypoints
axolotlextras.labelSizeWaypoints.tooltip=The size of the obsidian waypoint labels over beds and the invisibility waypoint labels.
axolotlextras.labelSizeNametags=Nametags
axolotlextras.labelSizeNametags.tooltip=The size of the nametags through walls.
axolotlextras.labelSizeArmor=Enemy Armor
axolotlextras.labelSizeArmor.tooltip=The size of the Enemy Armor labels.
axolotlextras.labelSizeProjectiles=Fireballs and Pearls
axolotlextras.labelSizeProjectiles.tooltip=The size of the fireball and pearl labels.
