axolotlextras.hackKeyNote=Hack Key Note
axolotlextras.hackKeyNote.tooltip=A short note above the hotbar when a hack key is used: the emergency toggle (G turns every hack off, H turns the ones that were on back on) or a hack's own toggle key. Set the keys in Controls, section AxolotlClient Extras: Hacks (the toggle keys start unbound). Off: no note at all.
